{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-06-22 16:15:00', 'title': 'HILLPHOENIX EXPANDS NATURAL REFRIGERATION OFFERINGS WITH NEW R290 SELF-CONTAINED CASES', 'text': "DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JUNE 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HILLPHOENIX, PART OF DOVER FOOD RETAIL\xa0AND DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV) AND A PIONEER IN DESIGNING ENVIRONMENTALLY SUSTAINABLE REFRIGERATION SYSTEMS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF R290 SELF-CONTAINED DISPLAY CASES, PART OF THE COMPANY'S SECOND NATURE® NATURAL PRODUCT LINE."}